        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$storyendjp_intro",
        "key": "$storyendjp_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Singing...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "How...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow, it's echoing through the whole town...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "A pale blue light spills over the desolate streets. In amongst the flickers of illumination, are people and the lives they led."
    },
    {
        "text": "The two stand alone in an otherwise empty town. The hazy song weaves into a web, and the sun continues to set."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltstreet1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.3,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Exposed Originium clusters, restless protesters, pale starlight, and mud bricks all fall silent together."
    },
    {
        "text": "All that remains... is the song..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltalley",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What is this... what am I seeing? Are these Originium Arts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "A folk song...? Or a poem? At sunset?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this a Wolumonde tradition?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Um... Miss Folinic, do you understand the lyrics?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No... is that the Leithanian tongue? It doesn't sound like modern Leithanian pronunciation...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But... it sounds nice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "It reminds me of looking out over the plains from the bridge of Rhodes Island for the very first time. It's melodious... ancient...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is... also Arts... but the same kind as the ancient Arts of Higashi!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
