        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Find them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure, but then what? Arrest them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_068"
    },
    {
        "text": "That'll just stir up even more resentment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're doing this to keep them from fomenting animosity between Infected and non-infected. The Winterwisps may well have been behind all this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Severin?! Wh-what is this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a Winterwisp ballad, for rituals and funerals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Winterwisps are responsible for agitating Infected conflicts and leading the partisans to destroy our power plant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now is not the time for leniency. They're trying to tell us something.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "They wouldn't tip their hand for no reason. There must be others out there in the shadows. Probably casters. Keep an eye out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly is a Winterwisp?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Local Caprinae. They were the people of these mountains, centuries ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened to them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wolumonde clashed with the Winterwisp. Nothing more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No. There's more to it than that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Columbia and Rim Billiton, pretty much every country has some kind of history of settler colonialism. There's another force at work here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just looking for a simple answer to dodge the question, aren't you? You'll just leave it as 'conflicts' and 'clashes?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not sure I should be talking about this with you. It goes beyond what Rhodes Island has a need to know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Gendarmerie telling these things to a foreign enterprise will make certain aristocrats very unhappy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're... worried about unhappy aristocrats...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 40,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Atro sacrificed herself for you! And you're talking about saving face?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": false
    },
    {
        "text": "M-Miss Folinic! Her sacrifice... shouldn't be ammunition for an argument.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Severin...! Can you please stop this manhunt? It's only agitating people. It's only going to make things worse!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... We're following our only lead. We can't afford to lose it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Severin, with as many nomadic cities as there are in Leithanien, do you really think any of those nobles give a shit about you from atop their ivory towers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even considering the Great Rift, if a nearby city were to offer support, would there really be a famine?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Severin, look at the situation. See for yourself who is really here to help you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know... Miss Folinic. I know better than anyone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I also know Rhodes Island can't help us forever. Once we're safe again and Wolumonde is back on course, I don't want to be getting letters from those ivory towers.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have to understand that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But Miss Folinic, we\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
