        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$frontline_intro",
        "key": "$frontline_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014An explosion?! Another attack?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_065"
    },
    {
        "text": "Schultz! Help! We need help!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Slow down. What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_065"
    },
    {
        "text": "They, they activated those town defense things! They exploded, and everything's burning, they\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Townsfolk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Schultz! The Infected... they've captured all of the Gendarmerie patrolling Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse! We lost contact with them!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're using the Gramophones to push us back. The whole district is out of control!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They shouldn't be so well-organized. Who's leading them?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't know. But a lot of the non-infected have joined the protest. Wolumonde is completely divided!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh. Damn you, Winterwisps...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Surround the district. Control the crowd. We have to take the town back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Cough* *cough*, *hack* *cough*!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Schultz!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn it... You get back to the Rathaus and sound the alarm. This has devolved into something far worse than just a dispute between the Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm putting Wolumonde under martial law. Raise the entire militia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But if we start killing each other now, Wolumonde won't survive the winter!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I gave you an order!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-yes sir!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you Rhodes Islanders... Do what you feel is right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be frank, I don't have time to keep an eye on you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I still need more information.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "B-but we should do what we can to help people first... A lot of innocent civilians are getting caught up in this mess...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll find the killer. That takes priority.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I promise, Wolumonde will provide Rhodes Island with a satisfactory answer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you'll keep that promise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If I'm still alive by then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
