        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Miss Folinic, we should have stopped Mr. Severin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No use. You saw them. The pressure's gotten to them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... is that so?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if a famine really is as imminent as the officer says, we'll still have to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...The only way to calm everyone down is to find the murderer as soon as possible. And letting our one lead go cold isn't an option.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not what I meant...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Folinic, do you really think finding the killer will solve all our problems?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#3",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Try to stay calm, Miss Folinic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Suzuran?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You know... everyone is burning with rage right now. Nobody has a clear head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think... it's just my gut feeling, but my intuition is usually pretty accurate!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think maybe... something even worse is starting to happen. The kind of thing that you can't be sure if it's right or wrong...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "What we have to do is try to help as many innocent people as we can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Folinic... If we don't stop Mr. Severin, things are going to get really, really bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Maybe you're right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#2",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_358_lisa_1#4",
        "name2": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Mm.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Suzuran"
    },
